  "nameEn": "Repair Crew of Functions",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"Gather\": a step and take. Function \"Repair\": a step, repair, light. Gather two kits, repair two lamps, turn right, gather one more and repair one more.",
  "descriptionEn": "First you must gather repair kits, and then repair the same number of lamps. Gathering and repairing are two separate functions.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Function \"Gather\": a step and take. Function \"Repair\": a step and repair. Gather two kits, repair two lamps, turn right, gather one more and repair one more."
